'''Digested Mushrooms''' are an {{Uncommon}} item that has a {{Green|20%}} chance of dropping from {{MobSprite|Mushroom Bull}}s, which spawn in the {{Zone|Mystic Marsh}} in the [[Crimson Isle]].  

== Obtaining ==
=== Mob Drops ===
{{Drop Sources}}

== Usage ==
=== [[Mooshroom Cow Pet]] ===
{{Item|Enchanted Mycelium|amount=64}} and {{Item|Digested Mushrooms|amount=32}} can be used to upgrade a {{Item|Mooshroom Cow Pet}} from {{Rare}} to {{Epic}} at {{NPCSprite|Kat}}.

{{Item|Enchanted Mycelium|amount=128}} and {{Item|Digested Mushrooms|amount=64}} can be used to upgrade a {{Item|Mooshroom Cow Pet}} from {{Epic}} to {{Legendary}} at {{NPCSprite|Kat}}.

=== Faction Quests ===
'''Digested Mushrooms''' can be requested as part of a Crimson Isle faction's daily quest.

